SUMMARY:Educator Workshop
DTSTAMP:20260731T111645Z
DTSTART:20260917T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Free\, registration requiredInstructor: Tiffany RitterAges 21+ 
	\n\n\n\nAll educators are welcome at our Educator Workshops\; classroom te
	achers\, outdoor educators\, scout leaders\, homeschool parents – anyone w
	ho wants to learn fun\, hands-on ways to teach children about science and 
	nature. \n\n\n\nHouston Arboretum & Nature Center is an approved CPE provi
	der for Texas Education Association. Teachers who attend our workshops rec
	eive official CPE credits and proof of attendance for each workshop. \n\n\
	n\nPlease wear closed-toe shoes as we will be walking on trails.   \n\n\n\
	n2026 – Registration is coming soon \n\n\n\n\nseptember 17\n\n\n\noctober 
	22\n\n\n\nNovember 19\n\n\n\ndecember 17\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nSpace is limite
	d\, please only register if you plan to attend. If your plans change and y
	ou are no longer able to attend\, email agreer@houstonarboretum.org \n\n\n
	\n\n\n\n\nSponsored By\n\nhttps://houstonarboretum.org/event/educator-work
	shop/2026-09-17/\n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
